{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f8f92b5554a9eac7931f4929216f9ed71cd4ed41d0811c4d1c2426d8333376d0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2da3b8c99758470d862bf99dc85b6433b0dec3cfc6af58782997576d9a5dbd42",
      "text": "来挥洒青春吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97a8e0d935cb257fce33d9af4b03daee8397e3967c75b742cb0930a27a734bed",
      "text": "四季被轻音部的演奏深深打动，\n来到了活动室。隼人和夏来为新部员的到来而高兴，\n面对吵吵闹闹的四季，旬则一脸无奈。\n另一边，春名则再次面临\n留级的危机。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000022:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000022:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2da3b8c99758470d862bf99dc85b6433b0dec3cfc6af58782997576d9a5dbd42",
      "text": "来挥洒青春吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:380ea8082f6f0bd1ee79292e47d5d9e13a1ae88673f02d8efa017341d6958eec",
      "text": "……以上就是将棋部的社团介绍。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8eed05c90ea64254b9164cca7617795f082361236e061d6a2c806c4209575ad",
      "text": "（目前为止没有觉得有意思的社团啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb8322f522a7111f89d67e08cec0cd0c8569f81c49b9e89d4062491e7849e280",
      "text": "（初中的时候全是不良少年，\n根本就不是搞社团活动的气氛）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b432e73c8577103dcdbc3ba111136a88e8dba03f556a27a915876f851d01764a",
      "text": "（高中还想着要不要尝试点什么呢，\n不过……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91a5c590b8be231cecb93c58fed4cc1f9ca716208f81cbed734d29166d94f860",
      "text": "按这感觉来看，好像不太行啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0e54973167b03c0340566a81b7a4fd5a76c497d10e1d4cb57c464d18a9c7874",
      "text": "接下来是轻音部。请！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8129766995bc0de2bd77d0eef58f1d876c3bcffa572cc4a76f48dac19898ac26",
      "text": "喂喂……各位新生，大家好！\n祝贺大家入学！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b39bccb95f0e6835f95f5fb8c836e23529acc5a1839800074c20e17323ba34e1",
      "text": "轻音部目前正在招募新成员！\n和我们一起挥洒青春吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:966246a5986160fcc88efa66413389c078ca80467bb41bcb75a9c8db9c1dcbe4",
      "text": "（青春……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a9f950cc316026c03e65ae76ec95088845855630e0a044cbbe046be57a15f06",
      "text": "那么请听一首我们演奏的曲子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e",
      "text": "哎……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c869a8fbeebfc53df5e5a72accb0f44b103e02d41f252f6f75126f2f972712de",
      "text": "（这是什么啊……超厉害的……！！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_a:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:089e699208756dfe6b5682b101c3cfce5f82aedbc333c296c32e3fb3e346fa34",
      "text": "我们正认真地以出道为目标而努力！\n请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc1e5c0e60fbbf46b7afe47c68db5e0a329f2cbea62d9fc26f6584b605e845de",
      "text": "啊——！坐立不安啊——！\n会不会有新部员过来呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc684f23b6b642092f5e917bcbda166865f9a9389b7f4077c6bdea4119027b5e",
      "text": "你在活动室里这么转来转去，\n也不会改变现状的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aca06a51e6671376fb27c449d5c1c41f45428e4d84c43461711315a07c6eddf",
      "text": "对了，要不我弹会儿吉他吧！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8bc582fba1c62c6245963672fdc449d4a1a44ef490a0c19f2a127e85e85a2f6",
      "text": "我现在正在做作业，\n请稍后再弹。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6734cb432fbcfe09257978929bcf8c77990c8bcb3df1337a6fae9b13ae54f7f2",
      "text": "怎么这样……！\n那我该怎么办才好啊～～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca2e003d3c6f09dbd1dd2b880c419cba8d9982b0d1aee3cb16fe259181dca36b",
      "text": "唉……\n隼人，你先冷静一下怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21499c45120cd6f1eacd542227dec2bd668809d517ac97f01259faf8d45b26c3",
      "text": "呜呜，说得也是啊。\n虽然我也明白……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c075ce2e7ab3ef9ec989888e3b535672326c3e5ce0aeb7bb503743050adfdb3d",
      "text": "可是前辈们毕业离开后，\n就只剩我们3个人了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2e9e8d290d169a3bf6cf6581e7ac768365930232b3e628c063b70a6216f52c5",
      "text": "一想到要是没有人加入该怎么办，\n就忍不住不安起来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:364cde691af0043334ebf22625915d8b8c461c8bd18084b4abc7c7b17d0a2ebe",
      "text": "隼人……\n一定，没问题的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c0c29f614502892170633f18d5126b87f046417d9915e00cfa5dabf5d679629",
      "text": "呃，轻音部，轻音部……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e903fb2ca93b5aac873fe5976c1ba3ccc6001b8869f1ac7c29ca274851f3c53",
      "text": "咦？不对，这里是刚才来过的地方！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:071390dbb5d74cc2c2a692a5f06cca46453bd6a1efbaa3d5183339f7ecbd3e55",
      "text": "那，是这边吗……？\n……哎哎，死胡同！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5509fe54d6f692aa2e18f8d1d65f27bcde9b461b0fee2b0ea6920e8d5e24b737",
      "text": "话说，这里到底是哪里啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e624ad44f34f56d0b6082b7aa7a74fa20c6c579b95c8f5db39b53e5c4f915f80",
      "text": "哇——！彻底迷路了！\n这所学校也太巨巨巨大了吧～！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aeda18c6a00a679ddec80487c1b95e4fc50e5042ccc516197d7e648e3779bd9",
      "text": "哇，那边有人……！？\n不好意思——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6abe2d90e478e23f4c76654b68cd2b07ae5cf36af29f2384468062c61c997bf7",
      "text": "……嗯？怎么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f73fb0ff99f5fd8c23847cec4a35de11ff84272d4f6df3a64d8ac286e0319f3e",
      "text": "（哇、哇啊，超级大帅哥啊！！\n是艺人？不对不对，是这所学校的前辈吧？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eb8189c2e058e1c267190e4b6563678ecd8a9f3d18cb6f533547095e559a936",
      "text": "那个，我正在找轻音部！\n您知道在哪里吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_c:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:606e4e04cd9e5340e3282b85d3cd0fce2354983fa9536b802d158720e90cac25",
      "text": "轻音部？啊——……在哪来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_c:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3051cec5d6a0eb6eb1c027eac0fd43b56d7975015e717a59da95f5fe5e0f6",
      "text": "大概穿过这条走廊\n往右拐好像就是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_c:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75174bff9cbb8192f34a3f0696d60ee79c94cbf1a5b5adc0821bc753fc7b97ee",
      "text": "呜哦，简直是救命稻草！\n真的太感谢了～～！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_c:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e46a182f0e49322174be19afc08120dc88bd7dc29e54a6877474657925c61c50",
      "text": "真是个精神满满的新生啊～……\n哎呀，糟了。不快点的话打工要迟到了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe87ee3df8d03b1068d694d3efd54294c70da17be2a670beb0d2ab8a0e9a4967",
      "text": "轻音部……终于找到了！\n今天从这里开始，我的青春就要拉开序幕了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8d8e2ef30848ac502610ef880ba3392b701834f50626930bd08785f53a3692e",
      "text": "啊！难道说，是新部员……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4266e20d3c4c4ec83651bf262d75bd9d8384f8f1a52241a8bada6b6ffa985f50",
      "text": "你们好！我看了社团介绍过来的！\n……等等，咦？咦咦咦！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8436a0779886c00329fda028dd1cf74796b9578385189964d66d0ec362579c9f",
      "text": "站在那里的，不就是隼人前辈吗！？\n感动的初次相遇！超级炸裂！冷静点我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:987d69fc53d819034048b55577a89b58fe0a1e335b49b49d895ddda9f74c0fe1",
      "text": "我看完了隼人前辈的舞台才跑过来的！\n前辈们的演奏，真的让我太感动了！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30fb81a4be23494cbe1bfecfbe2aeac0bba42af7e56b95c46d218e6e7a8b7912",
      "text": "也就是说，我也要一起组乐队！\n干劲十足火力全开，请多……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_d:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:961e5c12a5933c30e5f5c15229a09a995d49db90db5b8cfc96354ef3c5f256fa",
      "text": "……咦？\n怎么突然鸦雀无声了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_d:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b59c834d8afbe0f0c36b0e96e983cdc92085aefee82dc7d15c51344ce7edfd5d",
      "text": "……啊，抱、抱歉！\n突然被这么猛烈地夸奖，太吃惊了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_d:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b981e149a456c7c7dee564dfa154a82b2e424e2d27752b099a36b8e635b40781",
      "text": "不过，你是因为听了我们的演奏\n才来这里的啊。我真的太高兴了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_d:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b28dc364a8d50a6bc30dc755740ea4b9206b2eb1a77e76aa706c9ef986353a3b",
      "text": "好有……热情呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_d:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ace77c1f2eb58c8e9473975286427e95dbfd8d8d42db89d24bd89f7b13adb482",
      "text": "也没有那么厉害啦☆\n啊，对了，要吃糖果吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_d:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b9018aa8282902156a963ed645484da930911420ae60b8d27247732475388cb",
      "text": "（……这人到底是怎么回事啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:675129bfa55b1b105e488658f79689e5271a4681c27a301e268440aa97d5bcb1",
      "text": "不过，让我热血沸腾起来的\n可是多亏了前辈们哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70f6a01fdaf06ec309cba477b6a20c76dcce472399e07e55fb13b2cd7a46e7da",
      "text": "社团介绍时弹奏的那首歌，叫什么名字啊？\n那首歌也超级击中我内心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a254a17765758af7186179668728e23f0e91856342d9fefd9aefbf1c5c301a7c",
      "text": "虽然我也喜欢音乐，\n但那么帅气的曲子我还是第一次听！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7e5e22f4033236457f0f66d76cdd098b7a9c703f7a6635c3287b5f7a6b8b85d",
      "text": "哎，真的吗！？\n那是我们自己创作的歌曲哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dec3096e747a49ac99bfecae48a2da77b480240a13997224c382396d9162a671",
      "text": "哎——！原创！？\n那岂不是超级无敌强到不行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:805adc7436f289a27cdbc15f192a6c4f47d16e39882c9b9bdfd229621dc6ff8b",
      "text": "演奏厉害居然还能自己写歌，\n简直太膜拜了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14558983c69fdaa228463fecddaf45b8a4ff64baa40f6a8484724fc34bb60baa",
      "text": "啊哈哈……被当面这么夸还真有点害羞呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c70026b2fcc5e95b3e70fa1b14b0e82174b6edaa4837148941c29f6ca9000ae9",
      "text": "对了，差点忘了！前辈，这个……\n请收下我的入部申请书！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b45ab6925e27b6a95530fc8e440f008ac1f3b9f301104ef0ed1430e636acf26f",
      "text": "伊濑谷四季！\n请让我也和前辈们一起挥洒青春吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2511688d2ec7d90c2b06e193b36195d4281559c2e6bab3458f1fbf84ff2608df",
      "text": "……！当然可以！\n欢迎你，新成员！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_e:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3837d04b9a737bb20189f9242ec2a55033590ea43ab46516dc878a65ed1d0ab3",
      "text": "……呜呜，太好了～～。\n新部员终于来了～～……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4945f557b8801da80feb0d81af49b7ad8def8315c9f4b8b4d5f79feb7066ae08",
      "text": "等等，咦！？\n前辈……你哭了吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_e:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:345c747cfffed94b9664af907c7aba0b23b37abb63ab7f255effd483250ee6a0",
      "text": "……这是常有的事，不用在意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_e:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb8383fe5a92da4b745baa3f741e83749f64bca46267016c5ec1943f315a9d60",
      "text": "……隼人……太好了呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3de67430a38afca5b074558f3048e147eee7c84266cee9b0aa4f9023f9bde021",
      "text": "那么，我重新介绍一下成员吧。\n我是负责吉他的秋山隼人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9f05b3146583dec8783650fac30930cff7e93e27dcac0ccf0dfdd6271fecf72",
      "text": "这边是键盘手旬，还有贝斯手夏来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be14808769c2812bc7443f8db9aacd67ed739cf8c5a8b39658ab83c246d541bf",
      "text": "初次见面，请多关照……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88ca1395df562893db46c8b3ae54a26ebf976d074b79f5f801fdbbe6ff5ee2ee",
      "text": "姑且先向你说一句，请多指教。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8abc5778006e1a033634192e9cad3c08e6a4f27d1fb50e37301c1746533328cf",
      "text": "请多关照！\n……嗯嗯？姑且是什么意思？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9c894ec931935b3d4e89438e1bbe182ca22b8746d834f2eab29e36bd60fccdd",
      "text": "因为你目前还只是试用期。\n而且我们连你会什么乐器都还不知道……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_f:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c94985edf4dcdb76f2528bbf575f4019074087349e75db1cddf698cfc769cfb3",
      "text": "哎——！怎么这样！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d361dac4d6f7cfb0aa683ceb0e184ff658a423d1497a2298d582de0fac44f5fc",
      "text": "四、四季，你希望担任哪个位置？\n有什么会弹的乐器吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_f:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e75f70cdc9396aef4f876a9aac1763c0381efbf9698b90fb9dec18b9fb6a8c7f",
      "text": "……呼呼呼，问得好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ca9e87fe7ec7097b0c9fcbdf1613ecdf012670aff1c30456a6065ec7020fd7a",
      "text": "我当然是……想当主唱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1420986b93300398bca5457efa57a0cc6e21ba771682888175c2cd7089c1280d",
      "text": "这样啊！\n我们正好在招募主唱，真是帮大忙了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfd7c6be896e5df74e9ec8329b2e0aec2745bfb865b40714cf62a464bc45d5dd",
      "text": "我在卡拉OK可是能随心所欲地打出想要的分数，\n尽情期待吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f111ea7fa89f2320c2def5ad3543dafd3831f58bdc75e1535c4820f412e3f8d3",
      "text": "能操纵分数……好厉害……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc7137985d4c9d0340029c98d2260f7d44925d8ee0305fde1d9f00b546d63d6c",
      "text": "嘿嘿♪旬亲的键盘，\n还有夏来亲的贝斯也都太棒了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69f48b342deeeeb69d7182eb5ade56ca4dd34acb1c592520ea7713ba082b7e32",
      "text": "“旬亲”……？\n那是什么称呼啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f492fdaa9da0b5c3c4d3fce0ea21fa2724e1f256d8e74b36bff84287c7aa129",
      "text": "是绰号啦！因为\n我们不是接下来要一起共事的同伴嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aee1103d8b4e9be0bd0537a6ccf9bbbfb17b3b925a153702308b3f67e49287ff",
      "text": "……！\n我觉得挺好的，这种感觉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a14a3a1a72a6bbbf97abb5ecc1b46b929c11327743c6a03c24ae43347847a4bd",
      "text": "该怎么说呢，我开始搞乐队的理由……\n嘛、虽然也是想受女孩子欢迎啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:994f73b393ac33f75614551b8669acdcdeea8f62e5be0cfe99f55ff4c67a764e",
      "text": "另一个理由就是，想做很有青春感的事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_g:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf972ad45987ec204dc9598095ce59511905fddb052367a84cd06cc8d4b25260",
      "text": "伙伴、友情、羁绊之类的。\n想要体验一下那种感觉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:741bb1c603d76da23bd4f03cf1e617b85bb1495712bcbe3cd739e97c7e6d1410",
      "text": "我有点懂这种心情。我初中为止\n也是普普通通混过来的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d09a63979841733b1c2d951e93dbd85112d4d8332c055e1d5ceb0bc07e2949b5",
      "text": "我也是我也是！整天不是懒洋洋地看漫画，\n就是去买零食吃，或者再看漫画……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:883fd197d5e5af1b91be614b4fa8c3df047150682e0b229f46795a49dfe9dfa4",
      "text": "所以高中我想做出改变。\n把青春奉献给乐队！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:378dbe47df2b00bdd22762867ad4556884283a6100494e7081cc2cc29a718696",
      "text": "这么说，旬亲和夏来亲也是\n为了挥洒青春才加入社团的吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fbf84139df5acbffdc043b78c67734563a3c14fb21ba840977adac3775eeae9",
      "text": "并不是。\n我只是被隼人拉过来，顺其自然加入的而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0315aa7a9cb17c888fb97bc08838e731094d32b393c320ba9c9ded655d1b68ec",
      "text": "我也是……\n那个……是被旬，拉过来的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90d422a359a5eb8a4b856669017cb34e313d675cd8715fe2ee7d768627097709",
      "text": "他们两个人是青梅竹马，关系可好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac5764ffcfa76cf710ba251d1640cb00f662d764d95e56bffda3e6d9e41962c",
      "text": "哦，“青梅竹马”……！\n这不就超级无敌有青春感嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ffb5d2360e63bad2f1da2d16eeef40bd71bbc74d0f1047a33b2911d596a65a0",
      "text": "超级无敌，很有青春感……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c57c11a8acf07f9b2986ee423469130b3ff15fb99c8fd1fda5157fa8b01ae16",
      "text": "而且，夏来超级崇拜\n旬的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd19161a245b5bf7b74279fae432dbbe527da7deb9d1e0ba7a0c71daa00ca4ed",
      "text": "……嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59804378bb77b31586a3b0abb6290a8dbbca3da812ef88ad20e25f2add532fcc",
      "text": "呜呜……感觉好耀眼啊！\n我也要为了成为那样的伙伴而努力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e393c22460c49d223d9938085255c6a865c6219cefb2fb3de376462e9e20e82f",
      "text": "耶，轻音部！情绪高涨起来，\n让我们把团队默契拉满吧～～！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a43dc73e802af3bce94468ce41aa574cf898e4bc12c735bdb19f913d5ca90212",
      "text": "感觉……变热闹了，呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95576d317dd668ad6b1fdfb0c25463059c8f0b7f648dac39b5d91ac50ec8c32f",
      "text": "……夏来，这种程度应该叫吵闹了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_i:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf2304580d1cfa81f4eedf7f3de0c72a973a2d8afe513a1e461f91c2ee2fe2d1",
      "text": "哈啊～啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_i:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c42cb601fa937a9cf7b26d7416b2cf646005a61a35fb0a7a2741392efc30372",
      "text": "（连着打几份工，果然还是太吃力了啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10d7d053a2e4250d7e9e2fab07df159e4bbf7442641190697303962ea7cccc83",
      "text": "（保安的兼职一直干到早上。\n上课也困得不行，根本无法集中注意力……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_i:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3205a288618b0fbb0f378beeba4dda2fd0e6776ac73033e75319392ffaeb540b",
      "text": "（笔记本上一片空白。\n这样下去，考试又要完蛋了啊～……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cb2565c1b90c43ce038a121e300fed8039bd65a272dfbabadda77b874361bd1",
      "text": "算了，想再多也没用！\n今天不用打工，赶紧回家睡觉去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:caf1322b0ca03bca057e49f9e85ca2800d049c2476e4bac611c5693e3e8dd59d",
      "text": "若里君，明天见咯——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0505798afdc49ff6d2c72cd5549b54d37b7c4ab3ab0f1290fb9032c0512735dc",
      "text": "这个，方便的话拿去当点心吃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_i:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8000cf939151294fda2a38e2dd73d6447a0edb50aa600febde8c58d8c9006d28",
      "text": "哦，看起来很好吃的曲奇！谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_i:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d176f7902c8e0bb125b5de50b5f701c5c72740079b60bceac0e0ae7b85d75cf",
      "text": "呀——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b4bfb59e430a751786f11621188116a68b603065298ba795d6ba3a749b9c7ea",
      "text": "哼哼哼♪\n回家再吃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_i:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79d8d413eba4b792de52c87d11993d67d0df52a81855143fe580dd0f7dfc66e2",
      "text": "若里春名君。\n请立刻到教职工办公室来一趟。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:008612aa9803e4ef4f1b731ec40fb10be660339b5823d9cd697424823ad6ecc2",
      "text": "哎？什么事啊……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a1c56a1dd107c76133424af62fefc4fa31c93c53753ac364a9e3683ef59d4dc",
      "text": "打扰啦——！\n老师～，找我有什么事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f2ba91af062d15d87f53c614431f0e5defc18c26329904242f4c49d990e7950",
      "text": "若里君。\n今天的课你又睡着了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd5aad468922769daccb845108fbe77d67eeec368d0982c4c98e943da9c6584b",
      "text": "抱歉，抱歉！\n因为打工到早上，一个不小心就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92cbf3f7b20ca616d8a4357e29ae7d4713ea10a9684b232c59442d73104101f9",
      "text": "考试挂科，出席天数也勉勉强强……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d81fb808668cefd4b00d73941f1882e928cdc00c0e18dcab61c89b36cc6e115",
      "text": "你到底要留级多少次才甘心啊？\n再这样下去，下次真的要被退学了哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18c0482bdd2a3bff6d5c0e443cabdbe20cea4ef5934c3054a3a25fca0078c7a4",
      "text": "……退学！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ebd5eb204c38285ba24885e7934d8bc74282094e49b23cf8eb6c778fd92de17",
      "text": "没、没有什么挽回的办法吗？\n我会洗心革面的啦！拜托了～～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08be97d7e7b6755a7ca4d7abce6ac7f30cff3b39d2a7679dd31ab104b684c90d",
      "text": "这个嘛……\n至少在社团活动里做出点成绩的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad09012561b6d1983ba1ae0df33ef9cbaeb13cd6d4199c969335e66e6baca732",
      "text": "哎呀？\n若里君，你加入了轻音部啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f1a7a6359d1c84f802298a91f08642cf76f32ff7aabcb3bcec0db1f2572e55f",
      "text": "哎？……啊，好像确实加了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85799304f98b8655df68e5a044a3cbc667c6a05f45fd9cd14965dda6243a3e07",
      "text": "比如去参加比赛获奖之类的……\n如果有能得到认可的成绩，应该就能毕业了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4510e66232640d17fc32e3cfaecb6bdfb0b1cb7127ccb39e2181e19e57ffa77a",
      "text": "真的……假的！？太好啦——！\n那我明天就去轻音部看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
